{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2300504,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300504,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":230050403,"next_line_ids":[230050404],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":2185309850,"text":"嗯…是你们啊？","raw_text":"嗯…是你们啊？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300504.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2300504,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300504,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":230050404,"next_line_ids":[230050405],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":600850226,"text":"唉，看见我这幅愁眉苦脸的样子，你们应该多少也猜到些了吧？","raw_text":"唉，看见我这幅愁眉苦脸的样子，你们应该多少也猜到些了吧？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300504.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2300504,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300504,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":230050405,"next_line_ids":[230050406],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1366839922,"text":"我坦白了，到现在为止，我的荷包已经瘪了一半了。","raw_text":"我坦白了，到现在为止，我的荷包已经瘪了一半了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300504.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2300504,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300504,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":230050406,"next_line_ids":[230050407],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1554214634,"text":"真奇怪…不应该这样的…","raw_text":"真奇怪…不应该这样的…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300504.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2300504,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300504,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":230050407,"next_line_ids":[230050408],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":3765589898,"text":"不过话说回来…我有一个猜想，也许这正是市场要腾飞的征兆。","raw_text":"不过话说回来…我有一个猜想，也许这正是市场要腾飞的征兆。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300504.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2300504,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300504,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":230050408,"next_line_ids":[230050409],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":3681881858,"text":"就像人们必须要先弯曲腿部，然后才能高高跃起。","raw_text":"就像人们必须要先弯曲腿部，然后才能高高跃起。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300504.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2300504,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300504,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":230050409,"next_line_ids":[230050410],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1841655474,"text":"换作期货交易市场也是一样，现在整个市场都来到了底部。接下来一定就是触底反弹的时刻了吧？","raw_text":"换作期货交易市场也是一样，现在整个市场都来到了底部。接下来一定就是触底反弹的时刻了吧？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300504.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2300504,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300504,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":230050410,"next_line_ids":[230050411,230050412],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":2459121474,"text":"也就是说，现在就是抄底的最好时机！","raw_text":"也就是说，现在就是抄底的最好时机！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300504.json"}
