{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2300505,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300505,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":230050501,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1104621506,"text":"上次亏的，这次一定要连本带利赚回来！","raw_text":"上次亏的，这次一定要连本带利赚回来！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300505.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":2300506,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300506,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":230050601,"next_line_ids":[230050602],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1457936178,"text":"这就是那位富翁的苹果酿吗？嗯，里面有一股不凡的香气，令人头脑清醒。","raw_text":"这就是那位富翁的苹果酿吗？嗯，里面有一股不凡的香气，令人头脑清醒。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300506.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":2300506,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300506,"sequence":1,"variant":0,"line_id":230050602,"next_line_ids":[230050603],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":2075469402,"text":"好啊！这一定是能给市场带来转变的好东西！","raw_text":"好啊！这一定是能给市场带来转变的好东西！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300506.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":2300506,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300506,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":230050603,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1648441970,"text":"我不会忘记你们的帮助的！二位，咱们回头见！","raw_text":"我不会忘记你们的帮助的！二位，咱们回头见！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300506.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":2300507,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300507,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":230050701,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":2251380482,"text":"好！品相绝佳的料理！我相信这次我买的期货肯定能一飞冲天！","raw_text":"好！品相绝佳的料理！我相信这次我买的期货肯定能一飞冲天！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300507.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":6,"subquest_id":2300508,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300508,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":230050801,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":2644896674,"text":"看起来品质不错，这回会能不能赚它个盆满钵满呢？","raw_text":"看起来品质不错，这回会能不能赚它个盆满钵满呢？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300508.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23005","main_id":23005,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"哈特姆的期货交易日已经到了，不知道他的收获如何呢？","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":7,"subquest_id":2300509,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300509,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":230050901,"next_line_ids":[230050902],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":2004377146,"text":"这份料理看起来有点奇怪啊…不管了，我要开工了。","raw_text":"这份料理看起来有点奇怪啊…不管了，我要开工了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300509.json"}
